      "text": "The standard approach to handling this sort of data is to design an *encoder--decoder* architecture (:numref:`fig_encoder_decoder`) consisting of two major components: an *encoder* that takes a variable-length sequence as input, and a *decoder* that acts as a conditional language model, taking in the encoded input and the leftwards context of the target sequence and predicting the subsequent token in the target sequence."
     },
